## 🏗️ Provider Endpoints Architecture

### Core API Endpoints

#### 1. Workspaces Management
- **GET `/api/workspaces`** - List all workspaces
- **POST `/api/workspaces`** - Create new workspace
- **GET `/api/workspaces/:id`** - Get workspace details
- **PUT `/api/workspaces/:id`** - Update workspace
- **DELETE `/api/workspaces/:id`** - Delete workspace
- **POST `/api/workspaces/:id/chat`** - Send message to workspace

#### 2. Chat & Conversations
- **GET `/api/chats`** - List chats
- **GET `/api/chats/:id`** - Get chat history
- **POST `/api/chats/:id/message`** - Send message
- **DELETE `/api/chats/:id`** - Clear chat history

#### 3. Documents & Knowledge Base
- **POST `/api/documents`** - Upload documents
- **GET `/api/documents`** - List documents
- **DELETE `/api/documents/:id`** - Delete document
- **POST `/api/workspaces/:id/documents`** - Add documents to workspace

#### 4. Agent Skills
- **GET `/api/agent-skills`** - List available agent skills
- **POST `/api/agent-skills/:hubId/invoke`** - Invoke custom agent skill

