## 🛠️ Advanced Integration Patterns

### 1. Real-time Streaming
```javascript
// Stream responses for better UX
const streamResponse = async (message, workspaceId) => {
  const response = await fetch(`https://your-anythingllm.com/api/workspaces/${workspaceId}/chat/stream`, {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Authorization': 'Bearer YOUR_API_KEY',
      'Content-Type': 'application/json'
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({ message })
  });

  const reader = response.body.getReader();
  const decoder = new TextDecoder();
  
  while (true) {
    const { done, value } = await reader.read();
    if (done) break;
    
    const chunk = decoder.decode(value);
    // Process streaming chunk
    onStreamData(chunk);
  }
};
```

### 2. Batch Processing
```javascript
// Process multiple requests efficiently
const batchProcess = async (requests, workspaceId) => {
  const promises = requests.map(request => 
    fetch(`https://your-anythingllm.com/api/workspaces/${workspaceId}/chat`, {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: {
        'Authorization': 'Bearer YOUR_API_KEY',
        'Content-Type': 'application/json'
      },
      body: JSON.stringify(request)
    })
  );
  
  const responses = await Promise.all(promises);
  return Promise.all(responses.map(r => r.json()));
};
```

