## 🗂️ Custom Agent Skills Architecture

### 1. File Structure
```bash
# Custom Agent Skills Location in Docker
/storage-directory/plugins/agent-skills/
├── your-skill-name/
│   ├── plugin.json          # Configuration file
│   ├── handler.js           # Main logic file
│   ├── README.md           # Documentation (optional)
│   └── node_modules/       # Dependencies (if needed)
```

### 2. Plugin Configuration (`plugin.json`)
```json
{
  "name": "Your Skill Name",
  "hubId": "your-skill-name",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A brief description of what this skill does",
  "entrypoint": {
    "latitude": {
      "type": "number",
      "required": true,
      "description": "Latitude coordinate"
    },
    "longitude": {
      "type": "number", 
      "required": true,
      "description": "Longitude coordinate"
    }
  },
  "setup_args": {
    "API_KEY": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "input": {
        "type": "text",
